a-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">Refined</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">Forged</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Ore\">?$/studs</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">$180/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">$220/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p><p>Obsidian can spawn only in <a href=\"/wiki/Blackstone\" title=\"Blackstone\">Blackstone</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Lavaslate\" title=\"Lavaslate\">Lavaslate</a> nodes, though if a piece of <a href=\"/wiki/Magmite\" title=\"Magmite\">Magmite</a> cools fully, it can be in <a href=\"/wiki/Flameslate\" title=\"Flameslate\">Flameslate</a>.   \n</p><p>The raw form of <b>Obsidian</b> takes on a deep navy-blue shade.   \n</p><p>Putting <b>Obsidian</b> in a <a href=\"/wiki/Industrial_Refinery\" title=\"Industrial Refinery\">refiner</a> raises the sell price to $180 per stud. Putting that refined <b>Obsidian</b> through a <a href=\"/wiki/Industrial_Forge\" title=\"Industrial Forge\">forge</a> further increases the price to $220 per stud. \n</p><p>Like any other material in the game, you can use refined and forged Obsidian to complete schematics.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Unlike most ores, Obsidian will instead take a stone-like appearance when forged, similarly to <a href=\"/wiki/Lithium\" title=\"Lithium\">Lithium</a>.</li>\n<li>Obsidian appears to have been silently heavily nerfed in the <span class=\"new\" title=\"1.95.0 Secret Update (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMS45NS4wX1NlY3JldF9VcGRhdGU/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">1.95.0 Secret Update</span>. It previously sold for $350/stud forged.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:Ore_Nav\" title=\"Template:Ore Nav\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:Ore_Nav\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Ore_Nav?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></span><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oaklands\" title=\"Oaklands Wiki\"><img alt=\"Oaklands Wiki\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"115\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Site-logo.png\" data-image-key=\"Site-logo.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e6/Site-logo.png